   * @x-autobe-specification Create a new cancellation request for an order item. Validate that the order item status is 'paid'. Reject if not. Enforce reason length between 10 and 500 characters. Create a new shopping_mall_cancellation_requests record with status='pending', customer_id from JWT, order_item_id from path, and reason from request body. Set created_at and updated_at to now. Do not update the order_item status. Return the full created cancellation request record.
